# direnv: load shell.nix (OpenTofu, Python + python-hcl2, git, TF_CLI_CONFIG_FILE) when you cd in.
# nix-direnv caches the environment in .direnv/ and re-evaluates only when a watched file changes.
# Run `direnv allow` once (and again after editing this file). Non-interactive: `direnv exec . tofu ...`.
use nix
watch_file tooling/local-provider.generated.tfrc
